  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/amal.elgammal/ontologies/2025/3/untitled-ontology-31#MBOM">
    <rdfs:comment>Represents the manufacturing-oriented version of the Bill of Materials (BOM). It details the specific components, subassemblies, and materials used during production, as well as their association with manufacturing processes, stations, and suppliers.
Each MBOM is derived from a Product’s engineering BOM and is used to support one or more Production Plans.</rdfs:comment>
    <j.0:blueprintClass>ProductionPlanBlueprint</j.0:blueprintClass>
    <j.0:blueprintClass>ProductBlueprint</j.0:blueprintClass>
  </owl:Class>
