  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/amal.elgammal/ontologies/2025/3/untitled-ontology-31#DeliverySchedule">
    <rdfs:comment>The DeliverySchedule class represents a plan or commitment for delivering a shipment (or product) to a customer or final destination.

It answers key questions like:
 When will this delivery happen?
 What is the agreed delivery window?
 Who is responsible for this delivery?
 Is the delivery on time?</rdfs:comment>
    <j.0:blueprintClass>LogisticsBlueprint</j.0:blueprintClass>
  </owl:Class>
