  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/amal.elgammal/ontologies/2025/3/untitled-ontology-31#ProductionPlan">
    <rdfs:comment>The ProductionPlan serves as the blueprint or recipe that tells how the manufacturing should be executed to fulfill a WorkOrder.</rdfs:comment>
    <j.0:blueprintClass>ProductionPlanBlueprint</j.0:blueprintClass>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/amal.elgammal/ontologies/2025/3/untitled-ontology-31#ProductionBottleneckEvent">
    <rdfs:comment>Represents an actionable event indicating a bottleneck in the production process that requires intervention to maintain efficiency and throughput.</rdfs:comment>
