  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/amal.elgammal/ontologies/2025/3/untitled-ontology-31#LeadManufacturer">
    <rdfs:comment>represents a strategic manufacturing entity responsible for orchestrating and executing core production activities within a smart supply chain network. It acts as the primary producer, coordinating with suppliers, managing resources, and ensuring the fulfillment of production plans under defined SLAs.</rdfs:comment>
