    <rdfs:comment>A Certification represents a formal recognition that an entity (supplier, material, product, etc.) meets certain standards.

Examples:

ISO 14001 (environmental management)

FSC (sustainable wood)

GOTS (organic textiles)

B Corp certification</rdfs:comment>
