    <rdfs:comment>This class represents the structured list of components and their quantities needed to manufacture a specific product.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment>Modeling Enhancements (Optional for Future)
To capture quantity per component, wecan:

Introduce a class BOMItem as an intermediate node between BillOfMaterials and Product, with a hasQuantity property.

Use an OWL n-ary pattern for component-quantity pairs.</rdfs:comment>
